OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FPolice bodycam shows the moment
OL,7,Ffraudster Pamela Gwinnett was arrested
OL,8,Fat Manchester Airport
OL,10,FA fraudster who "abused her position"
OL,11,Fto steal #300,000 from a vulnerable
OL,12,Fpensioner before fleeing abroad to
OL,13,Fevade justice has been arrested at
OL,14,FManchester Airport.
OL,16,FPamela Gwinnett posed as a caregiver
OL,17,Fto isolate Joan Green from her family,
OL,18,Fbefore transferring power of attorney
OL,19,Fto herself and raiding the 89-year-
OL,20,Fold's life savings.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
