FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FShe used the cash to fund an
OL,7,Fextravagant lifestyle, buying a car
OL,8,Fworth more than #20,000 and expensive
OL,9,Fbeauty and Botox treatments.
OL,11,FIn a bid to escape prosecution,
OL,12,FGwinnett fled to Tenerife in 2025. In
OL,13,Fher absence, she was convicted in
OL,14,FOctober that year and sentenced to six
OL,15,Fyears in prison for a string of
OL,16,Foffences, including fraud by abuse of
OL,17,Fposition and theft.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
