OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FThe National Crime Agency (NCA),
OL,7,FSpanish authorities and Greater
OL,8,FManchester Police (GMP) worked
OL,9,Ftogether to locate Gwinnett and begin
OL,10,Fthe process of her return to the UK
OL,11,Fwhere she will serve her sentence.
OL,13,FShe was extradited back to the UK from
OL,14,FSpain and arrested at Manchester
OL,15,FAirport on 30 July, to appear before
OL,16,FManchester Magistrates Court on 31
OL,17,FJuly, to face charges of failing to
OL,18,Fappear previously.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
