OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FPC Georgia Loughton, of GMP, hopes the
OL,7,Ffamily of Joan Green can have "some
OL,8,Ffrom of closure".
OL,10,F"This result is the culmination of a
OL,11,Ftenacious investigation ensuring that
OL,12,Fwe secured justice for the family of
OL,13,Fthe victim at the centre of this
OL,14,Fcase," she said.
OL,16,F"Work to convict Gwinnett and her
OL,17,Fevading justice has been ongoing for
OL,18,Fquite some time. We were relentless in
OL,19,Four commitment to bring her back to
OL,20,Fthe UK, where she will now serve her
OL,21,Fterm in prison."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
