SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FPreston Crown Court previously heard
OL,7,Fhow Gwinnett systematically targeted
OL,8,Fthe elderly resident, from Chorley,
OL,9,FLancashire, who she "occasionally did
OL,10,Fsome shopping and light cleaning for".
OL,12,FGwinnett used her position of trust to
OL,13,Fisolate Joan from her loved ones,
OL,14,Fcontrolling her life and blocking her
OL,15,Ffrom seeing her grandchildren and
OL,16,Fgreat-grandchildren, all while
OL,17,Fstripping her of her life savings.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
