PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FJudge Michael Maher told the court how
OL,7,Fthe fraudster padlocked the gates of
OL,8,FJoan's house and and changed the
OL,9,Flandline number "in order to isolate
OL,10,Fyour golden goose".
OL,12,FHe said: "When one of the carers
OL,13,Foverheard Joan asking you why her
OL,14,Ffamily didn't come around anymore, you
OL,15,Fsought to brainwash her saying they
OL,16,Fare not good enough for you.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,F"You controlled the use of her bank
OL,7,Fcards and you prevented her from
OL,8,Fseeing any banking staff about her
OL,9,Fmoney. To be blunt, she was under your
OL,10,Fthumb."
OL,12,FJoan passed away in 2022, before she
OL,13,Fcould see Gwinnett brought to justice.
OL,15,FJudge Maher described Gwinnett's
OL,16,Factions as "manipulative" and "greedy"
OL,17,F- and said her victim, who died 11
OL,18,Fdays shy of her 90th birthday, "was
OL,19,Fsimply a cash cow to be milked until
OL,20,Fshe was dry."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
