PN,36608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785511094
OL,3,CFraudster arrested at airport after
OL,4,Cstealing #300k from pensioner
OL,6,FClare Meehan from the NCA's National
OL,7,FExtradition Unit said: "Pamela
OL,8,FGwinnett abused her position as a
OL,9,Fcaregiver to commit serious fraud
OL,10,Foffences against a vulnerable woman.
OL,12,F"Since she fled the UK, the NCA has
OL,13,Fworked closely with Greater Manchester
OL,14,FPolice and our law enforcement
OL,15,Fpartners in Spain to secure her return
OL,16,Fto face justice.
OL,18,F"We continue to operate around the
OL,19,Fworld to ensure there is no place to
OL,20,Fhide for fugitives from UK justice."
OL,26,@oD@XOUtD@AOUzD@AOU|D@dO]
